{"unit_id":"tag:08MQ:statement","translation":"令<MATH_0001>为一个态射（morphism），在赋环拓扑斯（ringed topoi）的一阶增厚（first order thickenings）之间，如情形<REF_0001>中所述。令<MATH_0002>为一个<MATH_0003>-模（module），并令<MATH_0004>。假设<MATH_0005>是平坦的（flat），相对于<MATH_0006>，且<MATH_0007>是增厚的严格态射（strict morphism of thickenings）（定义<REF_0002>）。那么以下条件等价（equivalent）<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0008>是平坦的（flat），相对于<MATH_0009>，且\n<STRUCT_0003> 典范映射（canonical map）<MATH_0010>是同构（isomorphism）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n此外，此时映射（maps）<MATH_0011>是同构（isomorphisms）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"first order thickenings","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦的"},{"source_term":"strict morphism of thickenings","target_term":"增厚的严格态射"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦的"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"给定增厚态射，待决"},{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯","context":"增厚的空间，待决"},{"source_term":"first order thickenings","target_term":"一阶增厚","context":"给定增厚，待决"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"给定模，待决"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦的","context":"模的平坦性，待决"},{"source_term":"strict morphism of thickenings","target_term":"增厚的严格态射","context":"给定严格性条件，待决"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价","context":"条件等价，待决"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射","context":"相应的典范映射，待决"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"映射条件，待决"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"最后的映射，待决"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构","context":"结论，待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08MQ:proof","translation":"映射（map）<MATH_0001>是满射的（surjective），因为<MATH_0002>是增厚的严格态射（strict morphism of thickenings）。因此，最后的断言是（2）的推论。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n证明（1）和（2）的等价性（equivalence）。由定义，相对于<MATH_0003>的平坦性（flatness）意味着相对于<MATH_0004>的平坦性（flatness）。对于相对于<MATH_0005>的平坦性（flatness）也类似。注意，严格性（strictness），对于<MATH_0006>，以及假设<MATH_0007>，蕴含<MATH_0008>，作为层（sheaves），在<MATH_0009>上。此外，注意<MATH_0010>。因此，（1）和（2）的等价性（equivalence）由《景上的模（Modules on Sites）》引理<REF_0001>得到。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的"},{"source_term":"strict morphism of thickenings","target_term":"增厚的严格态射"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价性"},{"source_term":"flatness","target_term":"平坦性"},{"source_term":"flatness","target_term":"平坦性"},{"source_term":"flatness","target_term":"平坦性"},{"source_term":"strictness","target_term":"严格性"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价性"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"景上的模"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"给定映射，待决"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的","context":"映射的性质，待决"},{"source_term":"strict morphism of thickenings","target_term":"增厚的严格态射","context":"严格性条件，待决"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价性","context":"条件等价，待决"},{"source_term":"flatness","target_term":"平坦性","context":"相对于环的平坦性，待决"},{"source_term":"strictness","target_term":"严格性","context":"态射性质，待决"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"层的等式，待决"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"景上的模","context":"引用章名，待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08VU:statement","translation":"令<MATH_0001>为一个态射（morphism），在赋环拓扑斯（ringed topoi）的一阶增厚（first order thickenings）之间，如情形<REF_0001>中所述。令<MATH_0002>为一个<MATH_0003>-模（module），并令<MATH_0004>。假设<MATH_0005>是平坦的（flat），相对于<MATH_0006>，且<MATH_0007>是增厚的严格态射（strict morphism of thickenings）。那么以下条件等价（equivalent）<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0008>是一个<MATH_0009>-模（module），具有有限呈示（finite presentation），且\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0010>是一个<MATH_0011>-模（module），具有有限呈示（finite presentation）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"first order thickenings","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦的"},{"source_term":"strict morphism of thickenings","target_term":"增厚的严格态射"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限呈示"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限呈示"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"增厚态射，待决"},{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯","context":"给定空间，待决"},{"source_term":"first order thickenings","target_term":"一阶增厚","context":"给定增厚，待决"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"给定模，待决"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦的","context":"平坦性条件，待决"},{"source_term":"strict morphism of thickenings","target_term":"增厚的严格态射","context":"严格性条件，待决"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价","context":"两个条件，待决"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限呈示","context":"模的有限性，待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08VU:proof","translation":"蕴含（1）<MATH_0001>（2）由《景上的模（Modules on Sites）》引理<REF_0001>得到。对于反向蕴含，假设<MATH_0002>具有有限呈示（finite presentation）。我们可以且确实假设<MATH_0003>。由引理<REF_0002>，存在一个短正合列（short exact sequence）<MATH_0004>。令<MATH_0005>为一个对象（object），属于<MATH_0006>，使得<MATH_0007>有一个呈示（presentation）<MATH_0008>。将<MATH_0009>替换为一个覆盖（covering）的成员后，可以假设映射（map）<MATH_0010>提升为一个映射（map）<MATH_0011>。诱导映射（induced map）<MATH_0012>是满射的（surjective），由右正合性（right exactness），对于<MATH_0013>。因此，将<MATH_0014>替换为一个覆盖（covering）的成员后，可以找到一个提升（lift）<MATH_0015>，对应于给定映射（map）<MATH_0016>，使得<MATH_0017>是一个复形（complex）。再次使用右正合性（right exactness），对于<MATH_0018>，可见这个复形（complex）是正合的（exact）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"景上的模"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限呈示"},{"source_term":"short exact sequence","target_term":"短正合列"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"presentation","target_term":"呈示"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"induced map","target_term":"诱导映射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的"},{"source_term":"right exactness","target_term":"右正合性"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"lift","target_term":"提升"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"right exactness","target_term":"右正合性"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"景上的模","context":"引用章名，待决"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限呈示","context":"模的假设，待决"},{"source_term":"short exact sequence","target_term":"短正合列","context":"模的列，待决"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"景中的对象，待决"},{"source_term":"presentation","target_term":"呈示","context":"局部呈示，待决"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖